t this apartment again. We had a really wonderful time. A big thank you to Xuru. They really helped us out. Their service is amazing! Thank you so much! We will definitely return to one of your apartments.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5537545,"review":"Die Aussicht aus der Wohnung ist sehr schön. Die Wohnung war sehr sauber","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5632074,"review":"great place. access to pool and beach was a great plus. super clean.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5641806,"review":"Wszystko w jak najlepszy porządku, mieszkanie czyste, przyjemne. Jedynie lokal znajduje sie w środku osiedla więc trzeba przejść przez osiedle bo nie da sie podjechać pod same drzwi.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5644263,"review":"Very clean and well furnished place. Outstanding service and support every time I got to contact them . I also gave them a very short notice since we planned to go to el gouna the night before the booking . They managed to send us he access really quick and they were very responsive . I reported an issue with the wifi they got it sorted in 30 mins after the request. Absolutely this is my go to place when I come to el gouna again. Thank you","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5669327,"review":"مكان جميل يستحق الزيارة","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5714645,"review":"Always the best hosts! Always responsive and extremely helpful when something happens.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5725597,"review":"We arrived 1.5 late and we found the cleaning still ongoing \nIt was done in the rush very badly \nWe need to supervise the person for 30 min what should be redone .\nThe location from the parking is very far , walking distance is tiring with heat","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5729570,"review":"We had a great time","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5740458,"review":"When picking a place, I thought an apartment would be a hassle and not as clean as hotel. I was proven wrong though. The apartment was set and had the AC on when we arrived, and when we needed any answers to our questions as first time guests, they’d respond in a matter of 5-10 minutes actually. This was perfect for a family of 4 and I wish to do this again with them.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5741681,"review":"I had an amazing stay at Xuru Stays El Gouna! This was my first time in El Gouna, and it couldn’t have been more perfect. The place was clean, comfortable, and beautifully maintained. The location was ideal, making it easy to enjoy everything the area has to offer. The host was friendly, helpful, and made me feel truly welcome. I would definitely come back again and highly recommend it to anyone visiting El Gouna.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5762248,"review":"great stay","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5798587,"review":"Highly recommend.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5830298,"review":"Sehr schöne Unterkunft . Optimal für 2-4 Personen","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5836740,"review":"Positive:\nThe location is great, very comfortable appartment.\n\nNegative:\nIt wasn’t clean enough when we came.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5854605,"review":"Great host and great place to stay, walking distance to the beach and looks over a pool. Plenty of walking distance super markets and cafes.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5891010,"review":"Positive:\nGute Lage, ausreichend Platz, nettes Servicepersonal, sauber.\n\nNegative:\nEinige Küchenutensilien könnten ergänzt werden:\nBrotmesser, kleine scharfe Messer, Brettchen, Käsereibe, Schüsseln.\nWasserkocher war undicht.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5904426,"review":"Positive:\nKonumu\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5904556,"review":"Great stay by Xuru, unit was super clean and communication was prompt and efficient. Place is less than a minute walking from the beach, would stay again!","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5909769,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z"},{"id":5919326,"review":"Smooth check-in. Simply perfect.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5940128,"review":"Просторная квартира с двумя спальнями и ванными комнатами.  Рядом красивый бассейн. До моря очень близко.  Неполадку есть 2 магазина. Заселение бесконтактное, очень удобно.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5942586,"review":"Very amazing, would recommend!","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":6008163,"review":"Great place, quite spacious and responsive host.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6082105,"review":"This stay truly exceeded my expectations. The unit was spotless and fully equipped with everything needed for a comfortable stay. The location is unbeatable—only a 3-minute walk to the beach with convenient parking nearby. Check-in and check-out were a breeze, and the host was incredibly friendly and quick to respond to all my questions. I highly recommend this place !","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z"},{"id":6090964,"review":"It’s very nice apartment","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z"},{"id":6130152,"review":"Positive:\nThe apartment rented as address and unit numbers given by whatsapp was completely different from the one on the QR code\n\nNegative:\nThe communication is inexistant with the owner, we arrived and waited for hours and kept calling and texting to be able to have the code and all we received were automatic messages that we will be contacted soon","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6167772,"review":"nice","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"},{"id":6172050,"review":"The check in is late at 3 and check out is early at 11,\nThe floor was not clean and no parking near the apartment.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"},{"id":6175972,"review":"Disappointing stay at Xuru Stays. Terms were unclear, housekeeping was poor, and Xuru Stays lacked attentiveness. \r\n\r\nOverall, customer service fell below expectations.","rental_id":234993,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}